  "source_sha256": "7a1b494847a4f3e2fa21dd5a25758f085d9d0df89b1cffa2e817d02512a59a7f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dda980f2215c85f86471a05bb3e3aef76ceaf2ac404d66c3a6a5eabfc9d46fdd",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nBlock Bridge",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7433748b79ed1966691cc77be7c6a551f398158e1a6794a9667407cfa8293b2e",
      "text": "Wukong, Ao Bing and Pigsy\nbuild a track.\n“Choo-choo!\nHere comes the train!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b64ffd529e44ce4399d2401a06693a32bf5efb3b8a5225d56b586b3fada3507e",
      "text": "Oh no!\nA blue river is in the way.\n“The train needs a bridge.”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11e830002b3df4552393c7ee0a7d17fe9a741cbe570c420521a7218775cdfc93",
      "text": "“How wide is the river?” asks\nAo Bing.\n“Let’s measure it!”\nsays Wukong.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "89507a227bfc85343a2835b3e7390490aec7ece4308d28b9428617bf1137ef59",
      "text": "Wukong uses his blocks.\n“One, two, three.\nThree blocks wide!”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f85652469beeba5b316f7c8db383fc679928aaffcb6668fc4e0436380d374134",
      "text": "Ao Bing uses his blocks.\n“One, two, three, four, five.\nFive blocks wide!”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e90c0f82aceb591720a01b4df6ee6f60e620b23b3b66e47c278948e946b73c19",
      "text": "“Three!” says Wukong.\n“Five!” says Ao Bing.\nPigsy looks closely.\n“Your blocks are different!”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dc5ad9f6591cb10611cb9a389df02dee2fad2a6360d470d371eee1369e2c7572",
      "text": "Pigsy brings a box of\nyellow blocks.\n“These are all the same size.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "13d0c06b6a66ff8061bee44a603e3b852779af5b42f3eaa870a33bece2ff979e",
      "text": "Wukong puts them down fast.\nPlunk, plunk, plunk!\n“Wait!” says Pigsy.\n“No gaps!”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "784bf6cda9faca59ae06db5781355f64fe7a5247c761dbe252656e6eeb70a193",
      "text": "They push the\nblocks together.\nEnd to end.\nNo gaps.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8eda265a3e95290e178624cd73f8d1eb48f0e9f68f1e729df35aa9307d3fd051",
      "text": "“One, two, three, four.”\n“Four blocks wide!”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "62c16f53e10c17594928564344870b3576380bb7bc19c5c864f75ef328c21477",
      "text": "Ao Bing finds a board.\nIt is three blocks long.\n“Too short!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "504b54156349872da738b61e009919bc966d8b3a1679700835e900a4db7cb547",
      "text": "They try it anyway.\nPlop!\nIt lands in the river.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b4212aa720d9d99b85d62ce1c6b8d91e6def73be7ada0a670999690bd62dfdf3",
      "text": "Pigsy finds a longer board.\nIt is five blocks long.\nIt reaches both sides!\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f26d05d7da22a19dd3863a2e45bf897fba6128f89fab3625fce652e16fe9e5b6",
      "text": "“Choo-choo!”\nThe train rolls over\nthe bridge.\nEveryone cheers.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1d1b30458cfae89a07d116480882abea019642500238cf8974e5b00144a63e2c",
      "text": "Pigsy makes a sign for\nthe station.\nIt looks like a cookie.\n“Next stop: Snack Station!”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
