      "sha256": "36547f4a8bfe1fe46e3184b42b758cc55fba040af5b16092602dd8fc6c91120b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nBlocks of the same size,\nend to end, no gaps.\nHow wide is your river?\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends",
